      "id": "claim_995fe524c00e480d8d3108864771074e",
      "statement": "ARCHITECTURE.md is the current implementation map, and enabled capabilities and room grants are deployment configuration rather than documented facts: design proposals and historical measurements do not imply a deployed feature.",
