    {
      "id": "claim_799c1fe55d8341399b173e755cbdcba9",
      "statement": "`nora.__main__.build_app` has only three steps — load config, await `build_dependencies`, construct `App` — and `build_dependencies` in `nora/app/composition.py` is the whole composition root, owning the ordered fatal startup validation and the object graph; it is the one place that reads Settings, so stages receive dependencies rather than `Config`.",
