    {
      "id": "claim_be954db253ab4a09a9c89776c2025f81",
      "statement": "`Dispatcher.on_message` awaits `IngestPipeline.run` inline because ingest is deterministic and constructs no agent, but hands an admitted tag to `EngagementPipeline.run` through `BackgroundTasks.spawn` instead of awaiting it, because a model call can take seconds or hang.",
