    {
      "id": "claim_cb423ed9c8e346c19f553e16bc0405f3",
      "statement": "An untagged message in a room opted into the Relevance Gate is not admitted by the dispatcher: `EngageDecision.relevance_gate` only makes `ParticipationTrigger.note_message` note it for the quiescence window, and participation is not a third pipeline — any turn it causes goes through the fire path, never `EngagementPipeline`.",
      "evidence": [
