    {
      "id": "claim_ab13a40a28064d818c8294d7193450a9",
      "statement": "Ingestion runs its stages in a fixed order under one plumbing root span: room scope (an unallowlisted conversation is not recorded at all and ends `scope_refused`), identity resolution, media custody before the record row so durable handles land in the same INSERT, the record row, the durable stimulus, the memory feed, then the engage gate.",
