      "id": "claim_52208aa1167d4a9f9874ecec712777fa",
      "statement": "`config.toml` is validated against a frozen pydantic `Config` tree with `extra=\"forbid\"`, so an unknown key or a missing one is a startup failure rather than a default, and `nora.config.load()` is the only reader of the file.",
